OL,3,GNEWSA'I asked killer question to
OL,4,Amurderer Tracie Andrews'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA journalist who was the first to
OL,7,Fquestion murderer Tracie Andrews at a
OL,8,Fpolice news conference has recalled the
OL,9,Fmoment he became convinced she was
OL,10,Flying about her fiance's death.
OL,12,FRod Chaytor was among reporters
OL,13,Fcovering the murder of 25-year-old Lee
OL,14,FHarvey, who was stabbed 42 times by
OL,15,FAndrews as the couple travelled home
OL,16,Ffrom a pub in Bromsgrove,
OL,17,FWorcestershire, in December 1996.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
