OL,3,GNEWSA'I asked killer question to
OL,4,Amurderer Tracie Andrews'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndrews claimed the couple had been
OL,7,Fattacked in a road rage incident and
OL,8,Flater appeared alongside Harvey's
OL,9,Fparents at a police news conference to
OL,10,Fappeal for those responsible to come
OL,11,Fforward.
OL,13,FChaytor, who asked the first question
OL,14,Fat the news conference, said Andrews
OL,15,Fchanged part of her account almost
OL,16,Fimmediately.
